# Update Selection Contract

Verified against Shopware v6.7.15.1:
https://github.com/shopware/shopware/blob/v6.7.15.1/src/Core/Framework/Plugin/Command/Lifecycle/PluginUpdateAllCommand.php

The bulk command refreshes plugins, then selects updates as follows:

```php
foreach ($plugins as $plugin) {
    if ($plugin->getUpgradeVersion() === null || $plugin->getActive() === false) {
        continue;
    }
    $this->pluginLifecycleService->updatePlugin($plugin, $context);
}
```

The refresh process sets upgradeVersion only when the discovered artifact version is newer.
The supplied inventory is active at installed version 1.0.0 and the artifact is also 1.0.0.
A targeted plugin:update <Name> does not use this bulk selection gate; it is not used by this deployment script.
